File name: SLMCWRDF.MP
Path description: The first file is a path from the Slum Crossroads
  to the Western Road Fork, via the Crumbling Tunnels.  Its purpose
  is to give you a path into the Hills in case you don't have a
  rusty iron key handy.
Path starts: Slum Crossroads
Path ends: Western Road Fork
Area of the game: Original Game and Module 1
Level recommendation: N/A
Type of path: Path
File format: New
Monsters encountered: usual for slums, crumbling tunnels and hills

Additional information: Also included with this is a modified path
  from the Western Door to the Western Road Fork.  The only
  difference is that if the path fails (i.e., you don't get the
  key), it uses the Crumbling Tunnels path.  Have fun!
